# `yo cache gc` sweeps `context/` under the context lock: an orphaned index key
# dir goes, `context.lock` (which another process may hold) stays. The key
# dir holds `index.tsv`, not a real `manifest.txt`: `*.txt` is git-ignored
# repo-wide, and gc removes a key dir whatever it holds.
env=YO_CACHE_DIR=<PROJ>/cache
